                            <p class="text-blue-700 text-sm">Create a unique "personality" for your miniAuto robot. Program distinct behaviors, movement patterns, and responses that make your robot unique. Include at least 3 different "moods" or behavior modes that can be triggered by different conditions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Navigation -->
            <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; margin-top: 32px;">
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;">
